				</div>

				<div class="hero__foot">
					<p class="hero__lede">
						Third-year BSIT student in Manila. I've shipped an Android campus-alert app, a Telegram
						bot in daily use, and a chatbot for a nonprofit.
					</p>

					<div class="hero__side">
						<p class="status">Open to OJT / internship hours</p>
						<div class="hero__actions">
							<a class="btn" href="#work">
								See the work
